  "semantic_contracts": {
    "recovery": "finite candidate wins unchanged; otherwise finite_geometry maps NaN to0 and clamps to±f32MAX. This is recovery, not budget/precision/source/clip/memory admission.",
    "accumulation": "exact f64 history updates every call. Any nonfinite candidate sets recovered permanently; subsequent publications use that history rather than the saturated f32 value. Copy duplicates current state. exact is finite-precision history, not arbitrary precision.",
    "budget": "new requires finite axis>0 and finite cumulative>=axis. Extents use closed[0,cap]; coordinates use signed closed[-cumulative,+cumulative]. Each check copies immutable caps, not a consumable quota.",
    "arithmetic": "checked_add first admits both operands, compares f64 sum, then admits converted f32. scale admits axis input even count0, compares f64 product then admits f32. Frame endpoints are ordinary f32 additions; only listed resulting fields are checked.",
    "request_metadata": "+infinity is accepted only as Unbounded request metadata. request_extent returns it; directly constructed Bounded is not automatically validated. subtract first admits consumed in both branches, clamps bounded difference at0, does not revalidate existing Bounded.",
    "publication": "C02 first obtains Ready layout and successful font fence, calls admission259–264, builds rich artifact270+ or plain artifact295+ only afterward. Failed admission returns Failed before artifact construction.",
    "diagnostic": "publication borrows layout, mutably borrows session only for this call. Error converts both source endpoints to u32 or drops range; work units are saturating lines+boxes. C04 reject updates C05 geometry rejection_count(saturating) and last receipt, then GeometryTooLarge. Fallback count is separately updated by record_layout_error.",
    "limits": "Only explicitly enumerated widths/heights/font/line metrics/frames/baseline/advances/boxes/border are checked; not all metadata, semantic source correspondence, clipping or container inclusion.",
    "tests": "7 numeric unit tests plus1 direct admission fixture. Fixture verifies GeometryTooLarge and receipt owner/range/values; no artifact builder invocation. Actual ordering is C02 code evidence, not test execution."
  },
